    {
      "beat_id": "A31",
      "act": "ACT 3",
      "lane": "REMOTION",
      "narration_text": "The workflow tier is when your code decides what happens next. Tool-use: the model says 'call search()'; your code executes it and feeds the result back. Structured outputs: the model returns JSON your code parses. In both cases, your code is driving — it decides whether to keep looping, what the next message is, when to stop. The model is a very capable function call inside your while loop.",
