    {
      "beat_id": "A41",
      "act": "ACT 4",
      "lane": "REMOTION",
      "narration_text": "The seam between workflow and agent: four questions. Does your code decide what the next tool call is, or does the model? Does your code interpret the output, or does the model? Does your code hold the conversation state, or does the model? Is the next action determined before or after the model response? Workflow tier: your code drives all four. Agent tier: the model drives all four. A hybrid means you're managing the boundary manually.",
      "voice": "am_onyx",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "voice_kokoro": "am_onyx",
      "estimated_duration_s": 30,
